message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article below."
title: "Urbanisation-driven nocturnal warming amplification in rapidly expanding arid cities: analysis pipeline and derived results"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, derived results and figures for a study measuring the nocturnal urban warming
  increment across the United Arab Emirates over 1995-2024 from station records, satellite land-surface
  temperature, built-up surface and morphology, and testing its representation in ERA5-Land and
  NEX-GDDP-CMIP6.
